@startuml
' Palette: class; black-and-white View-DAO-Entity report style.
' Hình 3.4 - Thiết kế lớp Personal Document Assistant.
' Bố cục một mặt phẳng: View ở trên, DAO ở giữa, Entity ở dưới.
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam defaultFontColor #111111
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam ArrowColor #000000
skinparam ClassBorderColor #000000
skinparam ClassFontColor #111111
skinparam ClassAttributeFontColor #111111
skinparam ClassBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ClassHeaderBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam NoteBorderColor #000000
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam nodesep 28
skinparam ranksep 52
hide circle
top to bottom direction

class PersonalDocumentsView <<view>> {
  +loadDocuments(): PersonalDocument[]
  +selectDocuments(ids: UUID[]): void
  +openAssistant(): void
}
class PersonalAssistantView <<view>> {
  +open(selectedDocumentIds: UUID[]): void
  +submitPrompt(message: String): void
  +showAnswer(response: AssistantResponse): void
  +showNoEvidence(): void
}
class CitationView <<view>> {
  +open(citation: PageCitation): void
}
class QuizDraftReviewView <<view>> {
  +showDraft(draft: QuizDraft): void
  +acceptQuiz(quizId: UUID): void
  +rejectQuiz(quizId: UUID): void
}

class PersonalAssistantDAO <<DAO>> {
  +postMessage(conversationId: UUID, body: MessageRequest): AssistantResponse
}
class ConversationDAO <<DAO>> {
  +run(studentId: UUID, conversationId: UUID, request: MessageRequest): AssistantResponse
}
class ConversationScopeDAO <<DAO>> {
  +loadAuthorizedSnapshot(studentId: UUID, conversationId: UUID): AuthorizedScope
  +validateResult(scope: AuthorizedScope, result: AssistantResponse): void
}
class AiGatewayDAO <<DAO>> {
  +runAssistant(request: InternalAssistantRequest): AssistantResponse
}
class OrchestratorDAO <<DAO>> {
  +run(request: InternalAssistantRequest): AssistantResponse
  -selectTool(message: String): ToolName
}
class AskDocumentDAO <<DAO>> {
  +execute(args: AskArgs, scope: AuthorizedScope): AnswerResult
}
class SummarizeDocumentDAO <<DAO>> {
  +execute(args: SummaryArgs, scope: AuthorizedScope): SummaryResult
}
class GenerateQuizDAO <<DAO>> {
  +execute(args: QuizArgs, scope: AuthorizedScope): QuizDraft
}
class DocumentIndexDAO <<DAO>> {
  +search(scope: AuthorizedScope, query: String): EvidenceSet
}
class GroundingValidationDAO <<DAO>> {
  +validate(result: GeneratedResult, evidence: EvidenceSet): ValidationResult
}

class Student <<entity>> {
  -id: UUID
  -email: String
  -status: UserStatus
}
class PersonalDocument <<entity>> {
  -id: UUID
  -ownerId: UUID
  -version: Integer
  -processingStatus: ProcessingStatus
}
class ChatConversation <<entity>> {
  -id: UUID
  -studentId: UUID
  -status: ConversationStatus
}
class ConversationDocument <<entity>> {
  -conversationId: UUID
  -documentId: UUID
  -documentVersion: Integer
}
class ChatMessage <<entity>> {
  -id: UUID
  -role: MessageRole
  -capability: Capability
  -answerStatus: AnswerStatus
}
class DocumentIndex <<entity>> {
  -documentId: UUID
  -documentVersion: Integer
  -status: IndexStatus
}
class DocumentChunk <<entity>> {
  -pageNumber: Integer
  -chunkIndex: Integer
  -embedding: Vector[1024]
}
class AgentRun <<entity>> {
  -requestId: String
  -selectedTool: ToolName
  -status: RunStatus
}
class MessageRequest <<entity>> {
  +message: String
  +selectedDocumentIds: UUID[1..10]
}
class AssistantResponse <<entity>> {
  +status: AssistantStatus
  +capability: Capability
  +answer: String?
  +quizDraft: QuizDraft?
  +citations: PageCitation[]
}
class PageCitation <<entity>> {
  +documentId: UUID
  +pageNumber: Integer
  +excerpt: String
}
class QuizDraft <<entity>> {
  +questions: McqSingleQuestion[]
}

' Giữ ba vùng thị giác như mẫu: View trên, DAO giữa, Entity dưới.
PersonalDocumentsView -[hidden]right- PersonalAssistantView
PersonalAssistantView -[hidden]right- CitationView
CitationView -[hidden]right- QuizDraftReviewView
PersonalAssistantDAO -[hidden]right- ConversationDAO
ConversationDAO -[hidden]right- ConversationScopeDAO
ConversationScopeDAO -[hidden]right- AiGatewayDAO
AiGatewayDAO -[hidden]right- OrchestratorDAO
AskDocumentDAO -[hidden]right- SummarizeDocumentDAO
SummarizeDocumentDAO -[hidden]right- GenerateQuizDAO
GenerateQuizDAO -[hidden]right- DocumentIndexDAO
DocumentIndexDAO -[hidden]right- GroundingValidationDAO
PersonalDocumentsView -[hidden]down- PersonalAssistantDAO
PersonalAssistantDAO -[hidden]down- AskDocumentDAO
AskDocumentDAO -[hidden]down- Student

' View navigation and View-to-DAO dependencies.
PersonalDocumentsView --> PersonalAssistantView
PersonalAssistantView --> CitationView
PersonalAssistantView --> QuizDraftReviewView
PersonalAssistantView ..> MessageRequest
PersonalAssistantView ..> PersonalAssistantDAO
CitationView ..> PageCitation
QuizDraftReviewView ..> QuizDraft

' DAO flow.
PersonalAssistantDAO ..> ConversationDAO
ConversationDAO ..> ConversationScopeDAO
ConversationDAO ..> AiGatewayDAO
AiGatewayDAO ..> OrchestratorDAO : internal HTTP
OrchestratorDAO ..> AskDocumentDAO
OrchestratorDAO ..> SummarizeDocumentDAO
OrchestratorDAO ..> GenerateQuizDAO
AskDocumentDAO ..> DocumentIndexDAO
SummarizeDocumentDAO ..> DocumentIndexDAO
GenerateQuizDAO ..> DocumentIndexDAO
DocumentIndexDAO ..> GroundingValidationDAO

' Entity associations, aggregation and composition.
Student "1" -- "0..*" PersonalDocument : owns
Student "1" -- "0..*" ChatConversation
ChatConversation "1" *-- "1..*" ConversationDocument
PersonalDocument "1" -- "0..*" ConversationDocument
ChatConversation "1" *-- "0..*" ChatMessage
PersonalDocument "1" -- "1" DocumentIndex
DocumentIndex "1" *-- "1..*" DocumentChunk
ChatConversation "1" -- "0..*" AgentRun
AssistantResponse "1" *-- "0..*" PageCitation
AssistantResponse "1" o-- "0..1" QuizDraft

' DAO-to-Entity dependencies.
ConversationScopeDAO ..> Student
ConversationScopeDAO ..> PersonalDocument
ConversationScopeDAO ..> ChatConversation
ConversationDAO ..> ChatMessage
ConversationDAO ..> AssistantResponse
DocumentIndexDAO ..> DocumentIndex
DocumentIndexDAO ..> DocumentChunk
OrchestratorDAO ..> AgentRun

note right of OrchestratorDAO
  Single Agent chỉ chọn một công cụ trong danh sách cho phép.
  Prompt không được mở rộng phạm vi tài liệu
  hoặc thay đổi quy tắc Quiz.
end note

note right of DocumentIndexDAO
  Chỉ tìm trong Personal PDF thuộc Student
  và đúng phiên bản đã chọn.
  Thiếu bằng chứng thì trả NO_EVIDENCE.
end note
@enduml
